    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/releases/tag/v5.0.1"&gt;ML.NET 5.0.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[release/5.0] Avoid Microsoft.Bcl.Memory on modern .NET targets&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7773" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7773/hovercard"&gt;#7773&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compatibility note: .NET 8+ applications no longer require &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Bcl.Memory&lt;/code&gt; through these packages. .NET Standard 2.0 builds remain available with the dependency updated to &lt;strong&gt;9.0.14&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[release/5.0] Update Semantic Kernel to 1.71.0 with GenAI-scoped dependencies&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7783" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7783/hovercard"&gt;#7783&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build / Test updates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[release/5.0] Restore CI infrastructure and test downloads, and stabilize SDCA tests&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7695" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7695/hovercard"&gt;#7695&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7729" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7729/hovercard"&gt;#7729&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[release/5.0] Update macOS build machines and Arcade dependencies&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7560" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7560/hovercard"&gt;#7560&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7776" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/machinelearning/pull/7776/hovercard"&gt;#7776&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
